    "text": "22 hours ago San Rafael, CA – On Wednesday, May 20, 2026, San Rafael Police Department Detectives arrested Kevin Eric Allen, a 35-year-old San Rafael resident and San Rafael High School teacher, in connection with an illegal and inappropriate relationship with a minor under the age of 18. Allen has been suspended from employment with San Rafael High School since the incident was reported. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
